cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Koha MARC Helper: a copy cataloguing plugin for Koha"
abstract: >-
  A Koha plugin for copy cataloguing on the Add MARC record page. It searches
  library catalogues and open sources worldwide by ISBN, ISSN or title, builds
  a MARC 21 record following AACR2 and the library's local rules, checks the
  record and its headings against Library of Congress authorities and the
  library's own authority file, and fills the Koha form. Batch cataloguing
  stages reviewed records in Koha with a matching rule.
